# Skyclave Apparition's two abilities are separate (CR 603.10, 113.7a): Bot2 kills the Apparition with Lightning Bolt in response to its
# enters trigger. The leaves-the-battlefield trigger goes on the stack above it and resolves first, when nothing has been exiled
# yet, so no Illusion is made; then the enters trigger resolves and exiles Bot2's Mind Stone for good. Bot2 gets no token.

